<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK SELLS 20 MLN KROONS CDS.</title>
<headline>C.BANK SELLS 20 MLN KROONS CDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's central bank said on Monday it sold 20 million kroons in certificates of deposits in an auction.</p>
<p>The average interest rate was 4.75 percent, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>The central bank offered certificates of deposits worth 30 million kroons at its Monday's auction.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
